# What the browser checks install into their own image. One line: the browsers
# themselves already sit in the base image, and everything else in
# requirements.txt is something this one package brought.
#
#   playwright   the driver, chosen in docs/decisions/0015-a-browser-driver.md
#
# The version has to be the version the base image was built for. That image
# ships the browser builds playwright expects and no Python package at all, so a
# mismatch here means the driver goes looking for a browser build that is not
# there. mcr.microsoft.com/playwright/python:v1.62.0-noble pairs with this line.
#
# requirements.txt beside this file is the lock, and its first two lines are the
# command that regenerates it.
playwright==1.62.0
